@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@contentType = application/json

### Get the Lobby Info (in order to answer the questions)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v0/collections/lobbies HTTP/1.1

### Create the MemberAnswer
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v0/collections/member-answers/ HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "answerId": 1,
    "memberId": 1,
    "questionId": 1
}

### Join Lobby - With specific lobby ID
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v0/collections/lobbies/join HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "memberId": "f3865f95-938f-410f-bf5a-4348142c30e9",
    "lobbyId": "203de4be-47fc-4c87-b2b3-332aacba57da"
}

### Join Lobby - Find active lobby automatically
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v0/collections/lobbies/join HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "memberId": "f911c704-a792-4016-aea1-de13d5a97f9d"
}

### Quit Lobby
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v0/collections/lobbies/quit HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "memberId": "f3865f95-938f-410f-bf5a-4348142c30e9",
    "lobbyId": "203de4be-47fc-4c87-b2b3-332aacba57da"
}

# Join Lobby (POST)
# INPUT: Member
# - check if lobby exists
# - check if lobby accepts new users (lobby full & invite time expired)
# - check if user is valid
# - check if user is already in lobby (already answered the questions)
# OUTPUT: Lobby 
# - check if MemberAnswer of the user associated with the lobby question set exists
# - if all checks pass, return the updated lobby and add the user to the lobby
# OUTPUT: Lobby Updated or Error

# Quit Lobby (POST)
# INPUT: Member
# same as join
# OUTPUT: Lobby Updated or Error

